# Not written:
#   Ping from the inside: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   Web server over IPv6: no IPv4 address as the source
#   Ping and errors to the firewall: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   Default allow LAN IPv6 to any rule: no IPv4 address as the source
#   Servers fetch their updates: host names as the destination: Cato takes them as destinations on the internet only
#   Nothing from the list: 'Blocklist' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   Tunnel of the old application: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
